---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site.config';
---
<Base title="About" description={`About ${SITE.title}.`}>
  <article class="post prose">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>Hi — I'm just a regular office worker. No finance degree, no Wall Street job, no hot tips.
      I work 9 to 5 like most people, and after that I do my homework on US stocks.</p>
    <p>I started writing my analysis down to keep myself honest, and over the years it grew into a blog and a
      YouTube channel with a loyal audience back home in Korea. This site brings that work to English-speaking readers.</p>
    <h2>How I invest</h2>
    <p>My portfolio runs on two engines:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong><a href="/dividend-stocks/">Dividend stocks</a></strong> — companies and ETFs that pay me steady, growing cash.
        The dividends get reinvested, so the income snowballs while I'm at work.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="/growth-stocks/">Growth stocks</a></strong> — businesses that can be much bigger in ten years.
        They're the part of the portfolio built for long-term upside.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Income for today, growth for tomorrow. Most of what I write explains how a specific stock fits one of those two roles.</p>
    <p>What you'll find here: company deep dives, earnings recaps, ETF comparisons and the occasional portfolio update —
      written the way I'd explain it to a coworker over lunch. If an ordinary investor with limited time can understand it,
      I've done my job.</p>
  </article>
  <CTA />
</Base>
